Package: progenitorscore
Type: Package
Title: Call Hematopoietic Progenitor Types by Scoring Cells Against the BoneMarrowMap Atlas
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Conor M.", "Finlay", email = "cofinlay@tcd.ie", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Conor Finlay Lab, Trinity College Dublin", role = "cph"))
Description: Scores single cells with a linear model trained on the BoneMarrowMap atlas (Zeng et al. 2025, Blood Cancer Discovery 6:307-24, <doi:10.1158/2643-3230.BCD-24-0342>) and calls progenitor types. Model weights are plain tables. Code is MIT; the model tables are CC BY-NC 4.0 (see LICENSE-MODEL.md).
License: file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/finlay-immuno-lab/progenitor-score
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: utils
Suggests: Matrix, SeuratObject, Seurat
